        "description": {
            "value": "<p>This <em>+1 striking ghost touch sickle</em> is made of an impossibly dark steel that absorbs all surrounding light, causing shadows to cling to its blade and those around it to feel an unnatural chill.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Light Harvest</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (darkness, manipulate, void)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You swing the void sickle in a wide arc, drawing light into the blade. All non-magical light sources within 30 feet are immediately extinguished, and the next melee Strike you make with the void sickle before the end of your turn deals an additional @Damage[1d6[void]] damage.</p>"
